<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-005/7> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "the ASD group showed higher modular variability mainly in several default-mode regions, including the medial prefrontal cortex, posterior cingulate gyrus, and angular gyrus (Cohen’s d ranging from .19 to .33), and lower variability primarily in the visual cortex (Cohen’s d ranging from -.24 to -.19) (FDR corrected p < .05)" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-7> ;
