<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/1> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "We showcase our approach on a challenging large-scale dataset (ABIDE, with N > 2, 000) and report state-of-the-art accuracy results on rs-fMRI- based discrimination of autism patients and healthy controls." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:abstract (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "The study classifies autism vs. control using ABIDE resting-state fMRI connectomes with a 3D CNN." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/2> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "The ﬁrst phase of ABIDE (ABIDE-I) compiled data from 1112 individuals, comprising 539 individuals diagnosed with Autism Spec- trum Disorder (ASD) and 573 typical controls, from 17 sites. The second phase (ABIDE-II) was recently released, and consists of an additional 521 individuals with ASD and 593 healthy controls, from 19 sites." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Describes the full ABIDE I and ABIDE II releases used as the data source." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/3> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "In our experiments, we used ABIDE-I subject data that passed manual qual- ity assessments (QA) by all the functional raters. This yielded a ﬁnal sample size of 774 ABIDE-I subjects, comprising 379 subjects with ASD and 395 typical con- trols." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "ABIDE-I analysed subset: 774 subjects (379 ASD, 395 TD) selected by manual QA." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/4> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "Since manual QA was not yet available for ABIDE-II, we per- formed an automatic quality control by selecting those subjects that retained at least 100 frames or 4 minutes of fMRI scans after motion scrubbing [19]. Motion scrubbing was performed based on Framewise Displacement (FD), dis- carding one volume before and two volumes after the frame with FD exceeding 0.5mm [15]. This step yielded a ﬁnal ABIDE-II sample size of 163 individuals with ASD and 230 healthy controls." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "ABIDE-II held-out test subset (163 ASD, 230 TD) defined by an automatic motion-scrubbing QC rule (FD > 0.5mm, minimum 100 retained frames)." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/5> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "The Preprocessed Connectomes Project (PCP) released preprocessed versions of ABIDE using several pipelines [4]. We used the data processed through Conﬁgurable Pipeline for Analysis of Connectomes (CPAC). This pipeline includes slice timing correction, motion correction, global mean intensity normalization and standardization of functional data to MNI space (3x3x3 mm resolution) before the extraction of ROI time series." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Preprocessing used the PCP CPAC pipeline." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/6> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "First, we implemented a 10-fold cross-validation scheme for ABIDE-I to be consistent with previously reported classiﬁcation re- sults [1, 18]. Second, we trained each model on all of ABIDE-I and computed test performance on an independent held-out set from ABIDE-II. This is used for assessing the generalization behavior of diﬀerent classiﬁers. We report accu- racy and the receiver operating curves (ROC), along with corresponding area under the curves (AUC) for each of these scenarios." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Evaluation used 10-fold CV on ABIDE-I plus an independent held-out test on ABIDE-II, reporting accuracy and AUC." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/7> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "Previous studies have reported cross- validated classiﬁcation accuracies up to 67% on ABIDE-I, the ﬁrst phase of the ABIDE study [1]. The proposed CNN approach improves this accuracy to above 73%." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:results (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "The proposed 3D-CNN improves cross-validated ABIDE-I accuracy from a prior benchmark of 67% to above 73%." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-006/8> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "The ensemble achieves an AUC of 75.8%." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-00889-5_16> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_7623d661 full_text sha256:87f280d165804cd3bd9aa37e8ecce4c3893d35e28155361e906ab8cacfde478d section:results char:13725" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "The atlas-ensemble CNN achieves an AUC of 75.8% on the ABIDE-II independent test." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

