<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-011/2> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """For ABIDE, we considered data from all acquisition sites with at least 10 participants per
group and with both children and adults. After detailed quality control, only cases with accept-
able T1-weighted (T1w) MRI, surface extraction, and head motion in rs-fMRI were included.""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-1> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001627> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_748c6bc3 full_text sha256:35fb126e2efafd515969dee03225d03847b176d20b9baa99322233cce61c364a section:methods char:14782" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "ABIDE sites required at least 10 participants per group and both children and adults; QC required acceptable T1w MRI, surface extraction, and acceptable head motion in rs-fMRI." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-011/3> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """Participants with ASD were diagnosed based on an in-person interview administered by
board-certified mental health professionals using the gold standard diagnostics of the Autism
Diagnostic Observation Schedule (ADOS) [51] and/or Autism Diagnostic Interview-Revised
(ADI-R) [52,53].""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-1> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001627> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_748c6bc3 full_text sha256:35fb126e2efafd515969dee03225d03847b176d20b9baa99322233cce61c364a section:methods char:15060" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "ASD diagnosis was based on an in-person interview using ADOS and/or ADI-R gold-standard diagnostics." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-011/4> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """For the resting-state functional brain scans in ABIDE, we built on data previously made
available by the Preprocessed Connectomes initiative (http://preprocessed-connectomes-
project.org/abide). The preprocessing was performed with C-PAC (https://fcp-indi.github.io)
and included slice time correction, head motion correction, skull stripping, and intensity nor-
malization. The rs-fMRI data were detrended and adjusted for common nuisance effects
related to head motion, white matter, and cerebrospinal fluid signals using CompCor [58], fol-
lowed by band-pass filtering (0.01 to 0.1 Hz).""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-1> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001627> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_748c6bc3 full_text sha256:35fb126e2efafd515969dee03225d03847b176d20b9baa99322233cce61c364a section:methods char:20037" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "ABIDE rs-fMRI was preprocessed via the Preprocessed Connectomes initiative using C-PAC (slice-time correction, motion correction, skull stripping, intensity normalization, CompCor, band-pass filtering)." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-011/5> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """Func-
tional connectivity matrices were calculated at a single-participant level based on a widely used
parcellation atlas with 100 cortical regions [61].""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-1> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001627> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_748c6bc3 full_text sha256:35fb126e2efafd515969dee03225d03847b176d20b9baa99322233cce61c364a section:methods char:56935" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Functional connectivity matrices were computed using a 100-region (Schaefer-Yeo) cortical parcellation atlas." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-011/6> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """After matching, we ended up with 290 participants (145 participants per group)
