        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "The Preprocessed Connectomes Project (PCP) is a publicly available preprocessed version of data from both the 1,000 Functional Connectomes Project (FCP) and the International Neuroimaging Data-Sharing Initiative (INDI)3. We used data from the FCP using the conﬁgurable pipeline, the Analysis of Connectomes (CPAC)." ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-3> ;
