<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-039/5> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """To 
assess FC group differences, a general linear model was fitted to each edge, including 
diagnosis, age, sex, and mean framewise displacement (FD) as covariates.""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-4> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2022.12.018> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_c0914f68 full_text sha256:b330107220b790e910018891ad1008fb74275fa8105a77498ab0ac4755068f9c section:methods char:13177" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Group differences were assessed with a GLM per edge including diagnosis, age, sex and mean FD as covariates, analysed with the Network Based Statistic." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-039/6> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """At the primary component-forming threshold of p<0.05, the NT>ASD contrast revealed 
hypoconnectivity in autism that encompassed 13,001 edges (17.1% of the total number of 
edges) linking 376 brain regions (pfwe<0.001; Figure 1A-C). The ASD>NT contrast revealed 
hyperconnectivity in autism, including 16,767 edges (22% of the total number of edges; 
pfwe<0.001) and linking all 390 brain regions""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-4> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2022.12.018> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_c0914f68 full_text sha256:b330107220b790e910018891ad1008fb74275fa8105a77498ab0ac4755068f9c section:results char:16690" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Autism showed both brain-wide hypoconnectivity (13,001 edges, 17.1%) and hyperconnectivity (16,767 edges, 22%) relative to neurotypicals, each significant after family-wise error correction." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-039/7> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """To further demonstrate the robustness and replicability of our findings we conducted the full 
FC mapping and analysis of group differences separately in the LEAP and 
ABIDE 1&2 data.""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-4> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2022.12.018> ;
