<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-060/2> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """The ﬁrst phase of ABIDE (ABIDE-I)
compiles a dataset of 1112 individuals from 17 sites and
consists of 539 individuals with ASD and 573 typical controls. 
Since the scan parameters vary across sites, ABIDE is a highly
heterogeneous dataset. To avoid the impact of data heterogeneity,
we collected raw rs-fMRI data from the whole NYU site,
consisting of 79 ASD subjects and 105 normal controls (NCs).""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-4> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fnhum.2021.687288> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_c8a23e0a full_text sha256:865c466daa9019c36726624772a4e07a00052e4e335dce675709a0e38fd8e8b5 section:methods (whitespace/ligature-normalised match)" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "To avoid cross-site heterogeneity, the study restricted analysis to the single NYU site of ABIDE-I (79 ASD, 105 NC) rather than the full 539/573 ABIDE-I sample." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-060/3> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """We preprocessed the data using a widely adopted pipeline called
