correction, realignment to correct for motion, and bandpass
ﬁltering (0.01–0.1 Hz).""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-4> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fnhum.2021.687288> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_c8a23e0a full_text sha256:865c466daa9019c36726624772a4e07a00052e4e335dce675709a0e38fd8e8b5 section:methods char:15264" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Data were preprocessed with C-PAC (skull stripping, slice timing, motion realignment, bandpass filtering)." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

