<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-062/1> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """we selected a 
subgroup of 190 subjects (102 with ASD and 88 TD) according to the following criteria: male 
children (age range: 6.5–13 years); rs-fMRI data acquired with open eyes; data from the 
University sites that provided the largest number of scans (KKI, NYU, UCLA, UM).""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-6> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00620> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_81234492 full_text sha256:876abfb3d6edabfd02482ac0d3b483ea255089176d78d640d4617286e686e87e section:abstract char:2516" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Cohort was a 190-subject (102 ASD, 88 TD) subset of ABIDE I selected by age, sex, eye status and site." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-062/2> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """We analyzed the preprocessed data available on the ABIDE 
preprocessed homepage (29, 30), using the Configurable Pipeline 
for the Analysis of Connectomes (CPAC) (31), that includes slice-
timing, motion correction, intensity normalization, nuisance 
signal removal (e.g. tissue signals, low-frequency drifts), and 
registrations.""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-6> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00620> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_81234492 full_text sha256:876abfb3d6edabfd02482ac0d3b483ea255089176d78d640d4617286e686e87e section:methods char:11262" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Preprocessing used the Preprocessed Connectomes Project CPAC pipeline." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-062/3> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """Both anatomical and functional atlases were chosen to derive the 
FC measures; in particular, we chose Harvard-Oxford (HO) and 
Automatic Anatomical Labeling (AAL) as anatomical templates 
and Craddock-200 (CC) as functional templates to extract time 
series from brain regions""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-6> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00620> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_81234492 full_text sha256:876abfb3d6edabfd02482ac0d3b483ea255089176d78d640d4617286e686e87e section:methods char:11839" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Four atlases (AAL, HO, CC, Power) were compared for the connectivity analysis." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-062/4> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """a leave-site out cross-validation scheme was performed: 
each training set was composed by all the sites except one, that 
was left out for validation.""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-6> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00620> ;
    ex:sourceLocator "corpus local_81234492 full_text sha256:876abfb3d6edabfd02482ac0d3b483ea255089176d78d640d4617286e686e87e section:methods char:15325" ;
    ex:sourceQuoteVerified true ;
    ex:supportsClaim "Classification used a leave-one-site-out cross-validation scheme." ;
    ex:verifiedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/phase3-merge> .

<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-062/5> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """The mean L-SVM classification performance, 
in terms of the area under the ROC curve (AUC), was 0.75 ± 0.05. The highest performance 
was obtained using data from KKI, NYU and UCLA sites in training and data from UM as testing 
set (AUC = 0.83).""" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:repronim:abide:litreview/activity/charting-batch-6> ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00620> ;
