        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value "In this study, we used multiscale functional brain parcels. Brain parcels were created using a method known as the bootstrap analysis of stable clusters called BASC [32]. Scales were selected using a data- based method called MSTEPS [33]. There are different scales in this method. In this study, the scale is set to 122." ;
