<urn:repronim:abide:litreview/quote/S-094/4> a prov:Entity,
        ex:EvidenceQuote ;
    prov:value """We observed that an imbalance in intra- and inter-network FC across 11 RSNs in ASD individuals (p = 0.002) corresponds to a weakened relationship with RSN
